Style\n\nPagina: 72\n\nAt 10th level, you can choose a second option from the Fighting Style class feature.\n\nNivel 10 - Heroic Warrior\n\nPagina: 96\n\nThe thrill of battle drives you toward victory. During combat, you can give yourself XPHB whenever you start your turn without it.\n\nNivel 15 - Superior Critical\n\nPagina: 72\n\nStarting at 15th level, your weapon attacks score a critical hit on a roll of 18-20.\n\nNivel 15 - Superior Critical\n\nPagina: 96\n\nYour attack rolls with weapons and Unarmed Strikes can now score a XPHB on a roll of 18–20 on the d20.\n\nNivel 15 - Superior Critical\n\nNivel 18 - Survivor\n\nPagina: 72\n\nAt 18th level, you attain the pinnacle of resilience in battle. At the start of each of your turns, you regain hit points equal to 5 + your Constitution modifier if you have no more than half of your hit points left. You don't gain this benefit if you have 0 hit points.\n\nNivel 18 - Survivor\n\nPagina: 96\n\nYou attain the pinnacle of resilience in battle, giving you these benefits.\n\nDefy Death\n\nYou have XPHB on XPHB. Moreover, when you roll 18–20 on a XPHB, you gain the benefit of rolling a 20 on it.\n\nHeroic Rally\n\nAt the start of each of your turns, you regain XPHB equal to 5 plus your Constitution modifier if you are XPHB and have at least 1 XPHB.\n\nNivel 18 - Survivor"},
